msgid ""
msgstr ""#: ../../zh/community/release_policy.md:1
msgid "版本策略"
msgstr "Release Policy"

#: ../../zh/community/release_policy.md:3
msgid "版本号规则"
msgstr "Version Numbering"

#: ../../zh/community/release_policy.md:5
msgid ""
"Triton-Ascend 遵循 [PEP 440](https://peps.python.org/pep-0440/) 版本规范，版本号与上游"
" Triton 保持对齐：`vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH[rcN][.postN]`"
msgstr ""
"Triton-Ascend follows [PEP 440](https://peps.python.org/pep-0440/)"
"version specification, with version numbers aligned with upstream"
"Triton: `vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH[rcN][.postN]`"

#: ../../zh/community/release_policy.md:7
msgid "**MAJOR.MINOR**：与上游 Triton 版本一一对应，如 Triton-Ascend `3.2` 基于 Triton `3.2`"
msgstr "**MAJOR.MINOR**: Corresponds one-to-one with upstream Triton versions, e.g., Triton-Ascend `3.2` is based on Triton `3.2`"

#: ../../zh/community/release_policy.md:8
msgid ""
"**PATCH**：Triton-Ascend 的 `PATCH` 版本可能多于上游 Triton，用于做 `MAJOR.MINOR` "
"级别的问题修复或改进，例如 Triton-Ascend `3.2.0` 和 `3.2.1` 均是基于 Triton `3.2.0`"
msgstr "**PATCH**: Triton-Ascend's `PATCH` version may be higher than upstream Triton, used for issue fixes or improvements at the `MAJOR.MINOR` level, e.g., both Triton-Ascend `3.2.0` and `3.2.1` are based on Triton `3.2.0`"

#: ../../zh/community/release_policy.md:9
msgid "**rcN**：预发布候选版本（Release Candidate），按需发布，供社区提前测试和反馈"
msgstr "**rcN**: Release Candidate, published as needed for early testing and feedback from the community"

#: ../../zh/community/release_policy.md:10
msgid "**postN**：已发布版本的问题修复版本（Post Release），按需发布，针对已有稳定版本的补丁"
msgstr "**postN**: Post-release patches for already released versions, published as needed to address issues in stable versions"

#: ../../zh/community/release_policy.md:12
msgid "版本分支策略"
msgstr "Branching Strategy"

#: ../../zh/community/release_policy.md:14
msgid "`main` 分支为最新开发分支，跟踪上游 Triton 最新版本"
msgstr "The `main` branch is the latest development branch, tracking the latest upstream Triton version"

#: ../../zh/community/release_policy.md:15
msgid "每个发布版本创建对应的版本开发分支（如 `releases/v3.2.x`），该分支与社区拉取 release 的 commit id 相同"
msgstr "Each release version creates a corresponding release development branch (e.g., `releases/v3.2.x`), which has the same commit id as the community release"

#: ../../zh/community/release_policy.md:16
msgid "功能开发应在 fork 仓库中完成，通过 `PR` 合并至 Triton-Ascend 仓库"
msgstr "Feature development should be done in fork repositories and merged into the Triton-Ascend repository via `PR`"

#: ../../zh/community/release_policy.md:18
msgid "**`main` 分支对应关系：**"
msgstr "**`main` Branch Mapping:**"

