#: ../../zh/community/release_policy.md:26
msgid "维护分支的状态分为："
msgstr "Maintenance branch statuses include:"

#: ../../zh/community/release_policy.md:28
msgid "**活跃（`Active`）**：持续接受 Bug 修复、功能改进和安全补丁，会继续特性演进或发布新版本"
msgstr "**Active**: Continuously accepts bug fixes, feature improvements, and security patches; will continue to evolve features or release new versions"

#: ../../zh/community/release_policy.md:29
msgid "**维护（`Maintenance`）**：仅接受关键 Bug 修复和安全补丁，不再发布功能改进"
msgstr "**Maintenance**: Only accepts critical bug fixes and security patches; no longer releases feature improvements"

#: ../../zh/community/release_policy.md:30
msgid "**归档（`End of Life`）**：不再接受任何修复，分支停止维护"
msgstr "**End of Life**: No longer accepts any fixes; branch maintenance has stopped"

